      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wish this was possible. We have a similar problem with game nights, where we run multiple world instances and need to get our moderators in there first, to prepare. Our current strategy is a custom built world that allows moderators to walk through a barrier into a portal that others can't reach. It doesn't always work because people can join via the instances menu for the group faster than the moderators can prepare.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-22T12:28:16.413Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "To ensure smooth event hosting, we would like to be able to lift the restrictions of Role Restricted Group Instances from within the instance.\n\nWhen hosting an event in a Group Instance, both staff and participants join the instance at the same time.\n\nAs a result, staff members do not have time to prepare.\n\nBy allowing staff to prepare first and then unlock the instance, participants would also experience shorter waiting times.",
